  "changed": "F408 adds an explicit single-resource namespace property content read to API and CLI. GET namespace/properties accepts exactly one canonical path with a4KiB encoded query bound;namespace-properties validates the path before credential/database access. Both reuse the existing read/list,mount/mode,current-intake and shared-lock snapshot. Ordinary stat/list remain content-free;the new typed response states authorized-snapshot-at-read and grants no mutation,forwarding,execution or AI disclosure authority. Initial API404 and CLI unknown-command reds become focused selector/credential-boundary greens. Published OpenAPI preserves every typed entry/content field,finite bounds and exact observation;injected authority,false observations and malformed content are rejected. Tagged native API/DAV/CLI comparisons and private-mode/read-only permission proofs compile only locally. Affected vet,format and architecture pass. Real native outcomes and all final-source gates remain owed.",
